      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w15.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w15.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝から、太い雨。傘を叩く音で、目が覚めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "掲示板の前で、知る。「本日、全興行休止」この街の雨は、ただの天気じゃないらしい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが教えてくれた。「雨の日は、オッズが全部、一倍に戻るんです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「倍率が流れちゃうので、賭けが成立しないんですよ」倍率が、流れる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "数字を洗い流す雨、らしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "賭けのない街を、初めて歩いた。朝市の胴元は店じまいで、おじさんは軒先で豆を煎ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "みんな、することがない顔で、丁寧に時間を過ごしてた。耳も、心なしか、暇そうに垂れてる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨宿りに入った、閉店後のカジノカフェ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白ひげの剣士さんが、窓際で茶を前に、雨を見てた。剣は、椅子の背に立てかけてある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「監督どのか。座りなさい」向かいに座ると、彼はぽつり。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「雨はいい」「倍率が無いと、この街は、ただの街に戻る」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "上手すぎた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「いまの悩みは、ポイントの有効期限じゃ」深刻な顔で言うので、深刻な顔で答えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「失効前に、ご案内を出します」「頼む」世界を三度救った人との、いちばん実務的な約束。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、剣士さんが窓の外を見たまま言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あんたのとこの興行は、観ておると——」「続きがある感じがして、好きじゃよ」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.direction.mimi.shift.009",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w15.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "続きがある感じ。傘の中で、その言葉を持ち帰った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった人たちの街で、うちの興行は、続きの匂いがするらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "だったら——ちゃんと、続けなきゃ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "寮に戻ると、雨が上がりかけてた。窓の外で、街の灯が点き直していく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "倍率も、明日にはまた育ち始める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w15.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳に一行、書いた。「雨の日の街、好きだ」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w15.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
